Code shared with PJA
--------------------

pas/praarith.pas (binary arithmetic coder), pas/prablake3.pas (BLAKE3),
pas/praformat.pas (the container), pas/prafs.pas (verified writing),
pas/pracpu.pas, pas/pracli.pas (the command, adapted), pas/collisions.py and
the tests of those units (test_arith, test_blake3, test_format, test_prafs,
cli.sh, adapted) come from PJA (github.com/YadeWira/PJA, MIT, same author).
BLAKE3 follows its specification (github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3-specs).

packPNM
-------

PRA is the spiritual successor of packPNM by Matthias Stirner (LGPLv3). It
takes ideas from it, not code.
